WEBVTT

00:00:00.406 --> 00:00:01.416
(All characters and organisations in this drama are fictional.)

00:00:01.416 --> 00:00:02.416
(Filming with minors followed broadcast guidelines,)

00:00:02.416 --> 00:00:03.516
(and generative AI was used in select scenes.)

00:00:04.316 --> 00:00:05.316
(Geumje Police Station)

00:00:05.386 --> 00:00:07.386
(Episode 5)

00:00:16.796 --> 00:00:17.926
Running away again?

00:00:22.496 --> 00:00:24.066
If you are going to run, do it right this time.

00:00:25.166 --> 00:00:26.606
So we never have to see each other again.

00:00:36.216 --> 00:00:37.346
Mom.

00:00:38.716 --> 00:00:39.746
Sweetheart.

00:00:46.686 --> 00:00:48.756
Mom, that must have been really hard.

00:00:49.756 --> 00:00:50.756
Yes.

00:00:50.826 --> 00:00:52.796
Gyeol kept saying he wanted to see you,

00:00:52.866 --> 00:00:53.966
So I brought him along.

00:00:54.426 --> 00:00:55.596
Did everything go okay?

00:00:58.136 --> 00:00:59.206
Here, eat this.

00:01:00.866 --> 00:01:02.306
Why did you buy this?

00:01:03.206 --> 00:01:04.306
You need to eat.

00:01:08.946 --> 00:01:10.716
That guy looks really familiar.

00:01:11.586 --> 00:01:12.586
Who is he?

00:01:13.416 --> 00:01:14.446
Where have I seen him?

00:01:14.956 --> 00:01:16.616
I definitely know that face.

00:01:19.826 --> 00:01:22.926
- Honey, let's go. - Honey?

00:01:23.826 --> 00:01:25.026
Honey?

00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:31.066
Sure, let's do that. Gyeol, let's go. Come on, honey.

00:01:31.336 --> 00:01:32.506
Let's go.

00:01:53.626 --> 00:01:54.626
That's her, right?

00:01:54.726 --> 00:01:56.526
That was Gyu Rim, right? I was not seeing things, was I?

00:01:58.866 --> 00:01:59.866
We searched everywhere...

00:01:59.926 --> 00:02:01.026
And could not find a single trace of her,

00:02:01.296 --> 00:02:02.566
And she just shows up here?

00:02:03.836 --> 00:02:05.006
Why was she at a police station?

00:02:05.566 --> 00:02:10.136
No, that's not even the point. She called that monkey-faced guy...

00:02:10.206 --> 00:02:13.506
"honey." So that guy is her husband?

00:02:17.416 --> 00:02:18.716
She went and got married already?

00:02:20.286 --> 00:02:21.516
She must be out of her mind.

00:02:21.786 --> 00:02:24.186
How could she dump you and end up with that monkey guy?

00:02:24.956 --> 00:02:26.486
And who was that kid? Her son?

00:02:28.056 --> 00:02:29.856
If he's her son, that doesn't make sense.

00:02:30.126 --> 00:02:31.226
No way that's possible.

00:02:32.796 --> 00:02:35.066
- Jung Woo. - What? Why?

00:02:37.296 --> 00:02:38.636
Drive for me.

00:02:55.956 --> 00:02:57.486
Sorry, that startled you, didn't it?

00:02:57.956 --> 00:02:59.756
No, nothing to be sorry about.

00:03:00.286 --> 00:03:01.596
But why did you do that all of a sudden?

00:03:03.096 --> 00:03:05.766
- Well, it's because... - That man from earlier,

00:03:05.826 --> 00:03:07.566
You didn't want him looking down on Mom, right?

00:03:08.026 --> 00:03:09.036
Is that right?

00:03:09.736 --> 00:03:13.306
If he thinks you're her husband, he wouldn't dare mess with her,

00:03:13.366 --> 00:03:14.536
And you look dependable.

00:03:15.376 --> 00:03:16.536
Dependable?

00:03:18.546 --> 00:03:19.546
Is that true?

00:03:19.906 --> 00:03:22.716
That doesn't mean you're husband material for my mom,

00:03:22.776 --> 00:03:24.046
So don't get too excited.

00:03:28.616 --> 00:03:31.456
- Gyeol, no games starting today. - What?

00:03:32.756 --> 00:03:33.886
And you too.

00:03:34.386 --> 00:03:35.956
No matter how much Gyeol begs or threatens you,

00:03:36.026 --> 00:03:37.256
Don't bring him to a place like this.

00:03:37.456 --> 00:03:38.626
This is no place for a kid.

00:03:39.366 --> 00:03:42.336
Well, just make sure you never have to come here again.

00:03:43.536 --> 00:03:45.436
So eat this tofu properly.

00:03:46.006 --> 00:03:47.666
And never come back to a rough place like this.

00:03:47.966 --> 00:03:49.006
Got it?

00:03:49.876 --> 00:03:51.376
Am I really banned from games?

00:03:52.476 --> 00:03:54.846
Yes, I should have banned them a long time ago.

00:03:54.916 --> 00:03:58.586
You said if I studied just as hard, you would let me play.

00:03:58.886 --> 00:04:00.916
- You're banned, end of story. - But who was that guy?

00:04:00.986 --> 00:04:03.186
- That's not fair. - I definitely know that face.

00:04:03.256 --> 00:04:04.586
You're banned, period.

00:04:04.856 --> 00:04:06.756
- Mom. - I can't figure it out.

00:04:06.826 --> 00:04:08.356
- Mom. - Han Gyeol, enough.

00:04:08.426 --> 00:04:09.426
Wait up.

00:04:20.136 --> 00:04:21.136
Pull over.

00:04:21.736 --> 00:04:22.736
What?

00:04:23.006 --> 00:04:24.476
I said pull over.

00:04:35.386 --> 00:04:36.386
Hey!

00:04:46.096 --> 00:04:47.596
Why did you only ask for 100,000 dollars?

00:04:49.966 --> 00:04:52.006
If you were going to do it, ask for 100 million dollars.

00:04:53.066 --> 00:04:54.606
Am I only worth 100,000 dollars to you?

00:04:55.076 --> 00:04:56.376
What is he talking about?

00:04:59.106 --> 00:05:00.506
You said you wouldn't run away.

00:05:02.146 --> 00:05:03.546
That no matter what happened, you wouldn't run.

00:05:03.616 --> 00:05:04.776
You promised.

00:05:07.416 --> 00:05:08.456
I'm sorry.

00:05:09.516 --> 00:05:10.516
Sorry?

00:05:11.456 --> 00:05:12.586
You're sorry?

00:05:14.756 --> 00:05:16.856
Do you know what my life was like after you disappeared?

00:05:19.226 --> 00:05:22.466
For years, I searched for you, wandering all over the world,

00:05:22.536 --> 00:05:25.106
Like a madman who'd lost his mind.

00:05:25.106 --> 00:05:26.466
Do you have any idea what I went through?

00:05:28.606 --> 00:05:29.976
But you...

00:05:30.706 --> 00:05:32.946
You got married and had a child,

00:05:33.846 --> 00:05:36.046
And you're just living your life like nothing ever happened?

00:05:38.516 --> 00:05:40.286
- Mu Jin. - Shut up.

00:05:41.546 --> 00:05:43.186
How could you play with someone's life like that?

00:05:44.486 --> 00:05:46.386
Who do you think you are to mess with people's lives?

00:05:50.156 --> 00:05:51.426
Did you ever even love me?

00:05:54.766 --> 00:05:56.996
Are you even human? You heartless girl.

00:06:07.176 --> 00:06:08.246
Don't.

00:06:21.656 --> 00:06:22.656
Hey, man.

00:06:26.196 --> 00:06:28.226
This guy's completely lost it.

00:06:32.206 --> 00:06:33.206
Kim Mu Jin.

00:06:42.176 --> 00:06:43.616
I'm going to take a walk before I head in.

00:06:44.616 --> 00:06:46.886
You're not thinking of doing anything stupid, are you?

00:06:47.216 --> 00:06:48.456
Like I always say,

00:06:48.556 --> 00:06:50.186
There are plenty of other fish in the sea.

00:06:51.656 --> 00:06:53.326
I'll be back before we open for dinner.

00:07:17.876 --> 00:07:19.886
(Suragan Side Dishes)

00:07:22.356 --> 00:07:23.356
That's it.

00:07:24.486 --> 00:07:25.526
It's that guy.

00:07:28.226 --> 00:07:29.526
It's him, right?

00:07:30.926 --> 00:07:33.966
Nine years ago, at the restaurant, he said he liked you and was all...

00:07:37.866 --> 00:07:38.936
Oh, right.

00:07:39.236 --> 00:07:41.036
On second thought, that wasn't him.

00:07:41.436 --> 00:07:44.676
Right, that guy and this guy look totally different.

00:07:44.836 --> 00:07:46.846
I must have been mistaken.

00:07:47.176 --> 00:07:48.176
Mister.

00:07:48.716 --> 00:07:50.576
- What? - Why are you such a bad actor?

00:07:52.486 --> 00:07:56.116
Who's a bad actor? Me? No, I'm not.

00:07:59.086 --> 00:08:01.526
He looks similar, but it's not him, right?

00:08:01.726 --> 00:08:02.796
Right.

00:08:03.326 --> 00:08:05.626
I thought so for a second, but I guess he was mistaken too.

00:08:10.166 --> 00:08:12.236
Why? Do I seem like a bad actor too?

00:08:12.836 --> 00:08:13.836
A little?

00:08:14.166 --> 00:08:15.876
Trust me. It wasn't him.

00:08:16.476 --> 00:08:17.536
What are we going to do?

00:08:18.606 --> 00:08:20.976
Oh my, what a lovely sight.

00:08:21.476 --> 00:08:22.946
You really look like a family.

00:08:24.016 --> 00:08:25.016
Let's go.

00:08:25.316 --> 00:08:26.916
(Suragan Side Dishes)

00:08:27.746 --> 00:08:29.356
Like this, as one big family,

00:08:29.416 --> 00:08:31.216
Wouldn't it be nice if the three of you...

00:08:31.286 --> 00:08:32.356
Lived together happily?

00:08:32.426 --> 00:08:34.586
Such a lovely sight. Stay right there.

00:08:35.556 --> 00:08:38.596
Smile. Now get closer. Wow, what a picture.

00:08:38.896 --> 00:08:40.596
Why are you just standing there and taking this?

00:08:41.996 --> 00:08:43.296
I've tried to be patient with this woman,

00:08:43.366 --> 00:08:44.936
But this is too much.

00:08:45.566 --> 00:08:47.366
Who are you trying to pair up with whom?

00:08:48.106 --> 00:08:49.176
How could Han Gyu Rim and your family...

00:08:49.236 --> 00:08:52.006
- ever be one family? - Gyu Young.

00:08:52.906 --> 00:08:56.816
- Why did that vixen show up again? - I know.

00:08:56.976 --> 00:09:00.816
It's wishful thinking. Can't I even have wishful thinking?

00:09:00.886 --> 00:09:02.256
Mom, that's enough.

00:09:02.316 --> 00:09:03.786
So you're saying your wish...

00:09:03.856 --> 00:09:05.186
Is for Han Gyu Rim? Why her?

00:09:05.256 --> 00:09:09.256
Go look somewhere else. Find a woman who's on your son's level...

00:09:10.826 --> 00:09:13.366
Is that any way to talk to an adult?

00:09:13.426 --> 00:09:15.266
Why did you hit me? Did I say something wrong?

00:09:15.336 --> 00:09:18.566
I only said what was true. Gyeol, tell her.

00:09:19.206 --> 00:09:20.706
She only said what was true.

00:09:21.136 --> 00:09:24.336
The kind of true things that get you in trouble.

00:09:24.876 --> 00:09:26.146
Hey, Han Gyeol.

00:09:26.346 --> 00:09:29.616
My goodness, our Han Gyeol is a regular prosecutor.

00:09:29.676 --> 00:09:30.776
- Good job. - Mom, that's enough.

00:09:30.846 --> 00:09:31.846
What's with you?

00:09:31.916 --> 00:09:33.286
You used to say your mom was too good...

00:09:33.346 --> 00:09:34.586
For Kim Woo Bin even if he begged.

00:09:34.716 --> 00:09:37.456
Have you already fallen for that rice thief?

00:09:37.516 --> 00:09:40.256
What did you say? Did you just call my son...

00:09:40.326 --> 00:09:42.356
A rice thief?

00:09:42.956 --> 00:09:43.956
Why, you...

00:09:44.026 --> 00:09:46.726
You 100-year-old vixen.

00:09:46.796 --> 00:09:48.566
Mom, why are you being like this? Just stop.

00:09:48.666 --> 00:09:51.596
Ma'am, did you just call me a vixen?

00:09:51.666 --> 00:09:53.466
Did you see me acting like a vixen?

00:09:53.536 --> 00:09:57.206
Well, did you? Did you see my son stealing rice?

00:09:57.336 --> 00:09:59.176
- No, but... - Come here.

00:09:59.376 --> 00:10:01.676
Hey, Han Gyeol. You'd better get your head on straight too.

00:10:01.746 --> 00:10:04.576
You'll go from Han Gyeol to Jo Gyeol in an instant, you punk.

00:10:04.646 --> 00:10:08.146
- Shut your mouth. Can't you? - Why are you doing this to me?

00:10:08.416 --> 00:10:11.186
You'll become Jo Gyeol. Jo Gyeol.

00:10:12.026 --> 00:10:13.586
Wow.

00:10:13.656 --> 00:10:16.396
I wonder what fool would ever marry a brat like that.

00:10:17.056 --> 00:10:18.896
If you ever bring home a girl like that,

00:10:18.896 --> 00:10:22.196
I'll dig my own grave. So you'd better be smart.

00:10:22.266 --> 00:10:24.166
Am I crazy enough to date a girl like that?

00:10:24.636 --> 00:10:26.806
Salt. I should throw some salt. Bring me some salt.

00:10:26.866 --> 00:10:28.436
Even salt is a waste. That's enough. Stop it.

00:10:28.506 --> 00:10:32.376
Hey, I said let go. It hurts.

00:10:34.176 --> 00:10:35.976
Hey, it hurts.

00:10:38.146 --> 00:10:39.716
Gosh, that hurts.

00:10:40.286 --> 00:10:44.356
You're just brutishly strong. Am I going to have a bruise?

00:10:45.326 --> 00:10:47.186
Seriously, what's wrong with you?

00:10:47.686 --> 00:10:50.426
- What? - You don't come to the shop.

00:10:50.756 --> 00:10:52.626
Even if you heard what she was saying,

00:10:52.696 --> 00:10:54.826
You would've just pretended not to and left.

00:10:54.996 --> 00:10:56.966
So why are you picking a fight over everything today...

00:10:57.036 --> 00:10:59.206
And causing a scene?

00:10:59.836 --> 00:11:02.306
Because I hate the idea of becoming a family with that rice thief.

00:11:02.436 --> 00:11:04.806
Heung Sik? What's wrong with him?

00:11:05.906 --> 00:11:08.976
I've told you a million times. If you're going to date someone,

00:11:08.976 --> 00:11:11.446
Date someone who's at least half a step above you.

00:11:11.546 --> 00:11:13.716
You seem to be mistaken about something.

00:11:14.016 --> 00:11:17.956
- I'm not that great of a person. - I'm so pathetic,

00:11:17.956 --> 00:11:19.456
Lacking, and shabby...

00:11:19.456 --> 00:11:23.196
Heung Sik is 1,000, 10,000 times better and more wonderful than me.

00:11:23.296 --> 00:11:26.996
So you're saying you'll even marry that rice thief?

00:11:27.066 --> 00:11:28.796
I'd be grateful if he'd have me.

00:11:29.096 --> 00:11:30.596
Have you lost your mind?

00:11:30.696 --> 00:11:32.266
I'm more sane than I've ever been.

00:11:36.176 --> 00:11:37.776
Just because that rice thief...

00:11:37.836 --> 00:11:39.806
Saved you when you collapsed on the street,

00:11:39.876 --> 00:11:41.506
You seem to be all touched, but...

00:11:41.776 --> 00:11:44.116
Didn't you save his mother when she collapsed?

00:11:44.746 --> 00:11:46.646
So that makes you even, doesn't it?

00:11:46.716 --> 00:11:48.786
If it weren't for his mom and Heung Sik,

00:11:48.856 --> 00:11:50.286
I would have died back then.

00:11:51.686 --> 00:11:52.686
So?

00:11:53.726 --> 00:11:54.956
Are you really...

00:11:55.026 --> 00:11:56.956
Going to try to make something happen with those people?

00:11:57.526 --> 00:11:58.996
I'm dead set against it.

00:11:59.096 --> 00:12:00.596
I'm not the one who's being asked to get married.

00:12:00.666 --> 00:12:02.196
Why are you meddling in my life?

00:12:02.636 --> 00:12:05.536
Since when have you ever cared so much about me?

00:12:06.066 --> 00:12:07.766
I'm worried my own life will be ruined...

00:12:07.836 --> 00:12:10.206
Because of you.

00:12:10.576 --> 00:12:12.176
Please, I'm begging you.

00:12:12.246 --> 00:12:13.746
When I introduce you as family to people,

00:12:13.806 --> 00:12:15.846
Even if I can't be incredibly proud,

00:12:16.116 --> 00:12:18.846
At least don't embarrass me. Okay?

00:12:21.686 --> 00:12:24.056
You'd be better off seeing that guy you met eight years ago.

00:12:24.116 --> 00:12:25.756
At least he was good-looking.

00:12:25.956 --> 00:12:28.086
Why are you bringing him up all of a sudden?

00:12:28.226 --> 00:12:31.526
You startled me. You were crazy about that guy.

00:12:31.596 --> 00:12:34.996
- You talked in your sleep. - When did I ever do that?

00:12:35.066 --> 00:12:36.836
Why are you yelling all of a sudden?

00:12:40.636 --> 00:12:43.806
See? You do still like him.

00:12:43.876 --> 00:12:46.006
You're definitely not over him, are you?

00:12:48.546 --> 00:12:51.176
Stop talking such nonsense.

00:12:51.516 --> 00:12:52.816
If you're going to keep clashing with the owner,

00:12:52.916 --> 00:12:54.416
Don't come to the shop again.

00:12:57.786 --> 00:13:00.986
I was just trying to give you some advice.

00:13:03.496 --> 00:13:06.296
Did that leave a bruise?

00:13:23.216 --> 00:13:24.976
(No Married Couples Allowed)

00:13:29.486 --> 00:13:31.756
Are you trying to shut down the restaurant?

00:13:38.766 --> 00:13:40.426
No couples, and no married couples.

00:13:40.596 --> 00:13:43.736
- How are you going to do business? - People who want to come will come.

00:13:44.966 --> 00:13:47.166
Is it your dream to go out of business?

00:13:49.676 --> 00:13:50.776
Is something wrong?

00:13:51.836 --> 00:13:53.046
No.

00:13:53.676 --> 00:13:54.706
Aren't you busy?

00:13:55.816 --> 00:13:56.816
What is it?

00:13:57.216 --> 00:13:59.246
Do I need a reason to come here?

00:13:59.816 --> 00:14:01.316
You said we should eat sometime.

00:14:03.856 --> 00:14:07.026
Sorry, but let's do it another time. Okay?

00:14:08.156 --> 00:14:11.426
Something is definitely wrong. What is it?

00:14:12.966 --> 00:14:14.166
You should just go.

00:14:15.966 --> 00:14:17.896
- Why? - Just because.

00:14:20.066 --> 00:14:21.406
Go home, for today.

00:14:21.836 --> 00:14:25.306
- Give it back. - Go home before causing trouble.

00:14:27.106 --> 00:14:28.406
If this restaurant goes under,

00:14:29.176 --> 00:14:30.916
I think I might actually kill you.

00:14:46.426 --> 00:14:47.866
What is it?

00:14:50.436 --> 00:14:53.536
Mu Jin saw Gyu Rim today.

00:14:54.206 --> 00:14:55.506
Who is Gyu Rim?

00:14:56.176 --> 00:14:58.376
The Han Gyu Rim from back in the day?

00:15:04.046 --> 00:15:06.546
When? How? What happened?

00:15:06.986 --> 00:15:10.216
It was an unbelievable coincidence.

00:15:12.526 --> 00:15:15.186
Is it okay to just let him go like this?

00:15:15.456 --> 00:15:17.596
Seo Hyun, what if Mu Jin is on his way and...

00:15:17.656 --> 00:15:19.466
What if he crashes his car?

00:15:20.326 --> 00:15:21.496
Did he say she's still pretty?

00:15:21.866 --> 00:15:24.136
Is he still into her? Is he dying to be with her?

00:15:24.666 --> 00:15:26.236
Does he want to get back together with her?

00:15:26.306 --> 00:15:28.906
Gosh, I shouldn't have told you.

00:15:33.846 --> 00:15:36.376
But you don't have to worry.

00:15:36.516 --> 00:15:38.316
How can I not worry?

00:15:38.516 --> 00:15:39.746
I saw what Han Gyu Rim did to Mu Jin.

00:15:39.816 --> 00:15:41.916
I saw how broken he was.

00:15:42.316 --> 00:15:44.756
I know how much he's still in love with her.

00:15:47.156 --> 00:15:48.456
She's married, Gyu Rim.

00:15:50.956 --> 00:15:52.126
She even has a son.

00:15:53.996 --> 00:15:57.436
- She has a son? - He didn't know it was her son,

00:15:57.496 --> 00:16:00.106
And there was a problem while they were playing a game...

00:16:00.366 --> 00:16:01.606
Unbelievable.

00:16:02.206 --> 00:16:04.636
He ended up meeting her because of the son.

00:16:05.106 --> 00:16:08.176
Her son is that old? How old is he?

00:16:09.116 --> 00:16:11.676
I think he said he was eight.

00:16:13.516 --> 00:16:15.856
Han Gyu Rim and Mu Jin broke up eight years ago.

00:16:17.886 --> 00:16:19.386
Was Han Gyu Rim cheating on him?

00:16:46.186 --> 00:16:47.416
You don't like this place either?

00:16:52.326 --> 00:16:54.926
Did they get a new chef here? Why does it taste like this?

00:16:58.856 --> 00:16:59.996
It's delicious.

00:17:00.496 --> 00:17:01.726
I think it's still delicious.

00:17:01.796 --> 00:17:03.196
If you think it's so good, you can have it all.

00:17:03.396 --> 00:17:05.296
Get it out of here. I can't even stand the smell.

00:17:07.106 --> 00:17:09.176
You hate everything I bring you.

00:17:09.536 --> 00:17:11.706
Why have you completely lost your appetite all of a sudden?

00:17:12.646 --> 00:17:14.146
I guess it means I'm about to die.

00:17:16.946 --> 00:17:18.646
After hearing that Chairman Kim has a grandchild,

00:17:18.716 --> 00:17:20.386
You're not just being jealous, are you?

00:17:21.686 --> 00:17:23.256
His son is younger than Mu Jin,

00:17:23.316 --> 00:17:25.216
But he's already married with a child...

00:17:25.286 --> 00:17:26.326
Who is Mu Jin?

00:17:27.286 --> 00:17:29.296
Why are you talking about someone I don't even know?

00:17:33.396 --> 00:17:35.766
(Mu Jin)

00:17:44.176 --> 00:17:46.906
- Okay. I'll call you back. - You really didn't do anything?

00:17:47.706 --> 00:17:48.776
Do what out of nowhere?

00:17:48.846 --> 00:17:50.846
I'm asking if you and Mom really didn't do anything...

00:17:50.916 --> 00:17:51.916
To Gyu Rim.

00:17:52.946 --> 00:17:54.546
What are you talking about? This is completely random.

00:17:54.616 --> 00:17:57.586
That's not who Gyu Rim is. Even if the world were ending,

00:17:57.656 --> 00:17:59.356
She's not the kind of person who could do that.

00:17:59.956 --> 00:18:02.696
Either you or Mom must have done something.

00:18:02.796 --> 00:18:04.496
What did you do?

00:18:05.426 --> 00:18:07.826
What on earth did you do to Gyu Rim?

00:18:08.196 --> 00:18:09.296
You call me out of the blue,

00:18:09.296 --> 00:18:10.936
And I don't know why you're being like this,

00:18:11.536 --> 00:18:13.566
But I told you clearly eight years ago.

00:18:13.636 --> 00:18:17.406
Mom and I didn't do anything. Han Gyu Rim came to see us herself.

00:18:18.276 --> 00:18:21.046
She said she would break up with you for 100,000 dollars.

00:18:21.406 --> 00:18:22.816
You heard it with your own ears.

00:18:27.816 --> 00:18:29.256
Are you still hung up on Han Gyu Rim?

00:18:30.216 --> 00:18:31.386
It's been so long since you two broke up.

00:18:31.456 --> 00:18:33.056
Just how long are you going to keep this up?

00:18:48.736 --> 00:18:49.936
(Chairman Hong Ok Seon)

00:18:54.176 --> 00:18:55.176
It's Mu Jin.

00:18:56.716 --> 00:18:57.716
I didn't ask.

00:18:59.146 --> 00:19:01.486
Can't you be the one to reach out to Mu Jin first?

00:19:02.756 --> 00:19:04.786
He broke up with Han Gyu Rim a long time ago.

00:19:04.856 --> 00:19:06.156
(Chairman Hong Ok Seon)

00:19:07.886 --> 00:19:10.396
Han Gyu Rim was a good person.

00:19:10.896 --> 00:19:12.226
You and I were too harsh.

00:19:12.866 --> 00:19:15.226
Why are you talking so much? I can't get any work done.

00:19:15.796 --> 00:19:16.896
This is a place of business.

00:19:17.436 --> 00:19:18.996
Can't you separate business from your personal life?

00:19:20.036 --> 00:19:21.036
Is that it?

00:19:24.476 --> 00:19:26.246
Is it really that bad?

00:19:28.246 --> 00:19:29.246
The doctor...

00:19:31.476 --> 00:19:33.516
He told me to prepare for the worst.

00:19:35.856 --> 00:19:37.016
That's impossible.

00:19:37.616 --> 00:19:38.716
That's impossible.

00:19:39.256 --> 00:19:41.086
- I'm healthy without a single ache. - Did you get it?

00:19:41.686 --> 00:19:42.826
But why you?

00:19:43.096 --> 00:19:44.096
Excuse me.

00:19:44.496 --> 00:19:45.496
Yes.

00:19:45.596 --> 00:19:46.726
I'm sorry, honey.

00:19:48.066 --> 00:19:50.066
For showing you such a weak side of me.

00:19:50.666 --> 00:19:52.436
I really tried to hide it from you.

00:19:57.206 --> 00:19:58.936
Don't say things like that.

00:19:59.306 --> 00:20:02.616
If you keep talking like that, I'm going to get really upset.

00:20:07.216 --> 00:20:08.346
If it's just one,

00:20:09.816 --> 00:20:10.886
Will that be enough?

00:20:12.856 --> 00:20:14.986
I heard targeted therapy is expensive.

00:20:15.586 --> 00:20:17.056
Will that be enough?

00:20:22.366 --> 00:20:23.366
No.

00:20:24.036 --> 00:20:25.136
I'll figure it out.

00:20:26.336 --> 00:20:29.066
Even if I die right now, I've loved you with no regrets.

00:20:30.536 --> 00:20:31.706
So that's enough for me.

00:20:32.036 --> 00:20:33.906
No. I'll save you.

00:20:34.076 --> 00:20:36.476
No matter what, I'm going to save you.

00:20:36.816 --> 00:20:39.646
So don't you worry about money. All right?

00:20:40.146 --> 00:20:41.146
Honey!

00:20:49.496 --> 00:20:50.626
What do I do, Hee Na?

00:20:51.156 --> 00:20:52.566
My mom's having an affair.

00:20:58.166 --> 00:21:02.936
Hey, how is that an affair? Your father passed away, right?

00:21:03.106 --> 00:21:04.936
Your mother can date if she wants.

00:21:05.876 --> 00:21:07.946
I'm telling you, this isn't just a normal relationship.

00:21:08.376 --> 00:21:10.446
Of all people, she had to meet a bastard like him.

00:21:11.146 --> 00:21:13.816
What kind of bastard? A bird? You mean, like a bird?

00:21:24.256 --> 00:21:25.826
You can tell right away, can't you?

00:21:27.266 --> 00:21:29.266
He's obviously our age or even younger.

00:21:29.496 --> 00:21:31.096
Why would he be dating my mom?

00:21:34.536 --> 00:21:36.576
- It's obvious. - Totally.

00:21:36.636 --> 00:21:38.076
- A gigolo. - A gigolo.

00:21:38.176 --> 00:21:40.846
- Darn it. Exactly. - Darn it, what do we do?

00:21:41.506 --> 00:21:42.676
What am I going to do now?

00:21:43.146 --> 00:21:44.146
I think she already gave that bastard...

00:21:44.216 --> 00:21:45.216
Hundreds of thousands of dollars.

00:21:45.746 --> 00:21:47.046
What? Hundreds of thousands?

00:21:47.946 --> 00:21:49.756
The worst part is, there's no telling...

00:21:49.816 --> 00:21:51.456
How much more he'll bleed her for.

00:21:51.516 --> 00:21:53.426
Hey, have you talked to your mom about this?

00:21:53.886 --> 00:21:54.886
No.

00:21:55.386 --> 00:21:57.096
If I let on that I know, she'll cut me off.

00:21:57.156 --> 00:21:58.156
I won't get my inheritance.

00:21:58.626 --> 00:22:00.296
My younger brother knows all about it too,

00:22:00.366 --> 00:22:02.596
But he's not saying a word because he wants his inheritance too.

00:22:02.666 --> 00:22:04.596
Oh, wait a minute. You...

00:22:05.366 --> 00:22:07.266
Have you tried looking this "bird" guy up?

00:22:08.206 --> 00:22:09.206
Just his number.

00:22:09.576 --> 00:22:10.936
I swiped it while my mom was in the shower.

00:22:11.336 --> 00:22:12.406
Hey, give it to me.

00:22:13.806 --> 00:22:15.706
- What for? - Hurry.

00:22:16.016 --> 00:22:17.816
- Come on, hurry up. - All right, hold on.

00:22:21.946 --> 00:22:23.156
He's dead meat.

00:22:24.456 --> 00:22:25.656
Hey, what are you going to do?

00:22:31.056 --> 00:22:32.126
Exterminating the vermin.

00:22:42.536 --> 00:22:45.376
- Hello. - Don't you have anything to do?

00:22:48.906 --> 00:22:50.276
And what is it you think I'm doing?

00:22:50.946 --> 00:22:53.686
You're going around seducing innocent women and swindling them.

00:22:53.746 --> 00:22:55.216
You lousy gigolo.

00:22:56.356 --> 00:22:57.356
Who are you?

00:22:57.556 --> 00:23:00.526
Who am I? What are you going to do about it?

00:23:00.856 --> 00:23:02.186
Are you going to come seduce me too?

00:23:04.596 --> 00:23:06.596
From your voice, you sound like a kid.

00:23:06.666 --> 00:23:07.726
I don't do kids.

00:23:07.826 --> 00:23:10.636
- Call me when you're older. - Wow, what a lowlife...

00:23:12.596 --> 00:23:14.506
Does your mom know you live like this?

00:23:15.206 --> 00:23:17.236
That her son seduces women her age...

00:23:17.306 --> 00:23:19.576
And lives like a parasite? Does she know?

00:23:21.606 --> 00:23:22.646
I don't have a mom.

00:23:23.016 --> 00:23:24.176
Then does your dad know?

00:23:25.016 --> 00:23:26.586
Why? You don't have a dad either?

00:23:27.186 --> 00:23:29.086
What are you, an alien that fell from outer space?

00:23:31.486 --> 00:23:33.486
I found out everything about you.

00:23:33.556 --> 00:23:35.856
If you don't stop what you're doing right now,

00:23:35.956 --> 00:23:37.796
I'll go to your family. So you'd better watch out.

00:23:38.226 --> 00:23:40.796
That their child is destroying another family...

00:23:40.866 --> 00:23:42.836
And living lavishly off the money.

00:23:43.196 --> 00:23:46.236
I'll go to your family and expose everything.

00:23:47.336 --> 00:23:48.906
By any chance, am I dating your mother?

00:23:50.436 --> 00:23:51.476
Are you perhaps Min Ju?

00:23:51.606 --> 00:23:53.776
- And your mother is Choi Hye Sook? - Why?

00:23:58.216 --> 00:24:00.546
Hello?

00:24:01.016 --> 00:24:02.016
Hey.

00:24:02.786 --> 00:24:04.056
Hey, you lousy gigolo.

00:24:19.866 --> 00:24:21.536
Hey, why did you hang up?

00:24:21.636 --> 00:24:23.306
You must be bored with your normal life.

00:24:23.506 --> 00:24:25.376
How about a taste of prison life for a change?

00:24:26.006 --> 00:24:29.246
Just name the date. Since you're going anyway,

00:24:29.376 --> 00:24:31.476
I think the sweltering summer heat would be perfect.

00:24:31.776 --> 00:24:32.986
What do you think?

00:24:33.916 --> 00:24:35.646
If you're done acting up, let's leave it at that.

00:24:36.216 --> 00:24:38.416
I was just going to take a little money and leave,

00:24:38.486 --> 00:24:39.686
But if you keep provoking me...

00:24:40.726 --> 00:24:42.086
I might just become your new dad.

00:24:42.956 --> 00:24:45.056
Is that what you want? If you do, just say the word.

00:24:45.256 --> 00:24:47.296
You think I can't grant a wish for my daughter?

00:24:47.366 --> 00:24:48.496
As your new dad.

00:24:49.666 --> 00:24:50.666
What, you bastard?

00:24:51.196 --> 00:24:53.436
You're going to pay for this.

00:24:54.266 --> 00:24:55.636
I'm already paying for it,

00:24:56.576 --> 00:24:58.206
So my little daughter doesn't need to worry about me.

00:24:59.476 --> 00:25:01.076
Well, your new dad is very busy, so I have to go.

00:25:08.686 --> 00:25:11.656
This bastard is a complete scumbag.

00:25:12.086 --> 00:25:13.486
Why? What is he saying?

00:25:14.386 --> 00:25:16.086
The person you are calling has their phone turned off.

00:25:16.156 --> 00:25:17.296
You will be connected to voicemail.

00:25:17.796 --> 00:25:20.026
He turned it off? Unbelievable.

00:25:20.626 --> 00:25:22.466
How am I supposed to take this guy down?

00:25:23.096 --> 00:25:24.096
Gosh.

00:25:44.986 --> 00:25:45.986
(Young Gyu)

00:25:45.986 --> 00:25:47.526
Honey, you have a call.

00:25:48.186 --> 00:25:50.596
Could you get that for me? I'll be right there.

00:25:50.826 --> 00:25:51.826
Yes.

00:25:55.866 --> 00:25:57.196
Oh no, they're going to hang up.

00:26:00.466 --> 00:26:01.566
Yes, hello.

00:26:04.206 --> 00:26:06.876
Isn't this Chairman Jang Hoon Tae's phone?

00:26:07.476 --> 00:26:08.476
Yes, it is.

00:26:08.546 --> 00:26:10.246
The Chairman can't come...

00:26:10.246 --> 00:26:12.646
- to the phone right now. - Let me.

00:26:13.616 --> 00:26:14.916
Wait, one moment, please.

00:26:15.046 --> 00:26:16.046
Who is it?

00:26:22.156 --> 00:26:23.326
Yes, this is Jang Hoon Tae.

00:26:24.426 --> 00:26:25.556
This is Han Gyu Young.

00:26:26.196 --> 00:26:27.566
You must have left work early.

00:26:28.466 --> 00:26:31.636
Yes. I finished up early today. Yes.

00:26:33.136 --> 00:26:35.666
If you have a moment, could we meet briefly?

00:26:36.636 --> 00:26:37.636
Right now?

00:26:38.376 --> 00:26:39.806
Yes, right now.

00:26:42.506 --> 00:26:43.516
Is it urgent?

00:26:44.816 --> 00:26:46.076
I'll tell you when we meet.

00:26:47.316 --> 00:26:48.386
Okay, let's meet then.

00:26:48.816 --> 00:26:49.816
Where?

00:26:50.916 --> 00:26:52.056
Yes, I know the place.

00:26:52.756 --> 00:26:54.156
Okay, then...

00:26:54.256 --> 00:26:55.856
I'll head over there in 30 minutes.

00:26:56.596 --> 00:26:57.596
Okay.

00:27:00.966 --> 00:27:03.336
What could be so urgent that they want to see someone...

00:27:03.396 --> 00:27:04.696
Who's already home from work?

00:27:05.836 --> 00:27:08.406
I know. She said she'll tell me when we meet. Yes.

00:27:09.776 --> 00:27:11.676
Will you be having dinner there?

00:27:12.006 --> 00:27:15.446
No, no. Since I can already smell the pollack stew,

00:27:15.976 --> 00:27:18.276
I'll meet them quickly and come back to have dinner with you.

00:27:18.646 --> 00:27:19.886
Should I get your clothes for you?

00:27:20.746 --> 00:27:24.686
Oh, I can get them myself. Go on with your work. Okay?

00:27:44.836 --> 00:27:45.836
What is this?

00:27:47.146 --> 00:27:49.106
It's the money you lent me, Chairman.

00:27:52.016 --> 00:27:54.186
Thanks to your help, I was able to graduate...

00:27:54.246 --> 00:27:55.616
And study abroad.

00:27:56.116 --> 00:27:58.056
There, I was lucky enough to meet a wonderful man,

00:27:58.116 --> 00:27:59.386
And now we're getting married.

00:27:59.656 --> 00:28:00.656
Is that so?

00:28:02.226 --> 00:28:05.396
That's wonderful. I'll happily accept this.

00:28:07.466 --> 00:28:10.036
And congratulations on your marriage.

00:28:12.666 --> 00:28:13.806
But...

00:28:13.866 --> 00:28:17.506
Shouldn't you tell your mother the news about your wedding?

00:28:18.876 --> 00:28:19.876
No.

00:28:20.376 --> 00:28:23.476
I told my fiance's family that my mother passed away.

00:28:26.746 --> 00:28:28.186
My family, too,

00:28:28.246 --> 00:28:29.486
Has been living as if our mother's been dead...

00:28:29.546 --> 00:28:30.556
For a long time.

00:28:31.456 --> 00:28:34.426
And it's better for your family that way, isn't it, Chairman?

00:28:39.926 --> 00:28:41.296
Instead...

00:28:41.866 --> 00:28:43.296
Instead of my mother,

00:28:44.266 --> 00:28:46.566
Chairman, could you help me once...

00:28:47.266 --> 00:28:49.166
No, could you help me twice?

00:28:50.476 --> 00:28:51.476
Excuse me?

00:28:54.906 --> 00:28:56.876
At the formal family meeting and the wedding ceremony,

00:28:57.516 --> 00:29:00.016
You just have to pretend to be my father twice.

00:29:02.116 --> 00:29:03.516
Did your father pass away?

00:29:04.616 --> 00:29:07.226
As far as I know, he's still alive, isn't he?

00:29:08.356 --> 00:29:09.556
He's alive.

00:29:09.896 --> 00:29:10.896
Then?

00:29:10.956 --> 00:29:14.066
He's alive, but I'm embarrassed...

00:29:14.126 --> 00:29:16.796
I mean, I feel hesitant to introduce him to others.

00:29:21.806 --> 00:29:23.276
But still, you can't do that.

00:29:23.706 --> 00:29:25.406
My future in-laws...

00:29:25.476 --> 00:29:28.446
Are extremely prominent people, and my family is not on their level.

00:29:29.076 --> 00:29:31.216
I want to be their daughter-in-law so badly,

00:29:31.646 --> 00:29:34.016
And I didn't want to feel small, so I lied.

00:29:34.946 --> 00:29:36.716
I said my mother had passed away...

00:29:37.356 --> 00:29:39.016
And that my father is an entrepreneur.

00:29:41.156 --> 00:29:43.696
I even considered hiring an actor...

00:29:43.796 --> 00:29:45.456
But you're not a complete stranger,

00:29:45.726 --> 00:29:48.066
So I figured it would be better to ask you for help.

00:29:53.136 --> 00:29:54.436
It's absurd, isn't it?

00:29:57.676 --> 00:29:58.976
I'm sure you're thinking, "Is this girl crazy?"

00:29:59.036 --> 00:30:00.776
I know you must be shocked.

00:30:02.046 --> 00:30:03.746
But once you see my father,

00:30:03.816 --> 00:30:06.016
You'll understand why I'm acting like this.

00:30:08.616 --> 00:30:10.016
Please help me, Chairman.

00:30:23.966 --> 00:30:25.466
Hey, come on.

00:30:25.866 --> 00:30:29.036
What kind of man do you take me, Han Seok Joong, for?

00:30:29.366 --> 00:30:32.706
Do I look like I'd take your money and run off somewhere?

00:30:32.976 --> 00:30:35.776
Come on. I'm hurt.

00:30:36.546 --> 00:30:37.546
Yes?

00:30:38.276 --> 00:30:40.286
You're asking why I have a Gyeongsang accent?

00:30:41.086 --> 00:30:43.616
Didn't I tell you before?

00:30:44.216 --> 00:30:46.856
You and I are from the same hometown.

00:30:46.956 --> 00:30:47.956
That's right.

00:30:48.486 --> 00:30:51.526
In your hometown, Tongyeong, if you go straight down,

00:30:51.596 --> 00:30:52.956
You'll find an island called Bijindo.

00:30:53.196 --> 00:30:54.196
What?

00:30:54.866 --> 00:30:55.866
What?

00:30:56.936 --> 00:31:00.006
It's not Tongyeong, it's Suncheon? Oh my goodness, what have I done?

00:31:00.066 --> 00:31:03.176
Sir, what did I just say?

00:31:03.306 --> 00:31:05.306
Did I just say Tongyeong?

00:31:05.576 --> 00:31:07.106
Oh my goodness, I must be going crazy.

00:31:07.376 --> 00:31:10.516
I could just bite my tongue and die. This is unbelievable.

00:31:10.816 --> 00:31:12.676
Right, sir.

00:31:12.876 --> 00:31:15.946
I'm a real Suncheon man...

00:31:16.016 --> 00:31:18.416
And I nearly failed to recognise...

00:31:18.486 --> 00:31:21.526
Someone from my own hometown.

00:31:21.956 --> 00:31:23.726
Look, sir,

00:31:24.126 --> 00:31:26.356
Don't be like that. Please...

00:31:26.666 --> 00:31:28.096
Show some Suncheon spirit...

00:31:28.166 --> 00:31:32.666
And help me out just this once.

00:31:33.936 --> 00:31:38.176
Look, I promise I won't run off with your money.

00:31:38.276 --> 00:31:43.216
Okay, sir? Please, just cut me some slack.

00:31:45.146 --> 00:31:46.146
Hello?

00:31:46.816 --> 00:31:49.146
Hello? Sir. No, sir...

00:31:49.216 --> 00:31:51.656
Sir! Hello?

00:31:53.016 --> 00:31:55.726
He hung up. My gosh.

00:32:00.926 --> 00:32:01.926
Gyu Oh.

00:32:05.296 --> 00:32:06.636
I told you to meet me at the pub.

00:32:06.706 --> 00:32:08.406
So why did you ask me to come to the rooftop?

00:32:09.506 --> 00:32:11.406
What if the family finds out?

00:32:16.876 --> 00:32:18.216
This really is the last time.

00:32:20.586 --> 00:32:22.416
All right.

00:32:25.256 --> 00:32:27.386
You should've just gotten large bills.

00:32:27.486 --> 00:32:29.286
Why did you get so many?

00:32:29.656 --> 00:32:30.796
It's just bulky.

00:32:32.956 --> 00:32:34.796
Cleaning up after your messes...

00:32:34.866 --> 00:32:35.996
This is the last time I'm doing it for you...

00:32:36.066 --> 00:32:37.066
Instead of Gyu Rim.

00:32:38.336 --> 00:32:39.906
I said I get it.

00:32:40.966 --> 00:32:41.966
Seriously, next time,

00:32:41.966 --> 00:32:43.506
I don't care if you go to jail or die.

00:32:43.576 --> 00:32:44.576
You can clean up your own mess.

00:32:45.776 --> 00:32:47.976
Are you threatening your own father?

00:32:49.146 --> 00:32:51.046
Especially if you bother Gyu Rim,

00:32:51.116 --> 00:32:52.676
I swear, Dad, I won't let it slide.

00:32:54.146 --> 00:32:56.046
You won't let it slide? So what?

00:32:56.146 --> 00:32:57.456
Are you going to hit me?

00:32:58.916 --> 00:33:02.226
What number was I on? I completely lost count.

00:33:03.296 --> 00:33:04.326
One thousand...

00:33:04.926 --> 00:33:07.426
- Hey, hey, give me the money. - Gyu Seo and Gyu Min...

00:33:07.496 --> 00:33:11.136
- You shook them down for allowance. - Hey, that's absurd.

00:33:11.666 --> 00:33:13.606
I just said my one wish...

00:33:13.666 --> 00:33:14.706
Was to eat premium beef until I burst,

00:33:14.766 --> 00:33:17.936
And Gyu Min gave me a few bucks to at least buy some imported beef.

00:33:18.036 --> 00:33:19.276
That bastard Gyu Seo didn't give me a dime.

00:33:19.336 --> 00:33:20.346
Now give me the money, you punk.

00:33:20.406 --> 00:33:21.846
Fine, then promise me you won't bother...

00:33:21.846 --> 00:33:23.946
Gyu Rim, Gyu Min, or Gyu Seo.

00:33:24.216 --> 00:33:26.046
Promise you won't be a nuisance to them anymore.

00:33:26.616 --> 00:33:28.446
All right. I said I get it.

00:33:28.646 --> 00:33:30.186
So just give me the money, you punk.

00:33:30.256 --> 00:33:32.216
Taking back what you gave is the lowest of the low.

00:33:35.256 --> 00:33:36.796
Did you leave your money with him?

00:33:38.726 --> 00:33:40.496
I'm asking, did you leave your money with him?

00:33:40.726 --> 00:33:42.566
When are you going to grow up, Dad? Seriously.

00:33:43.026 --> 00:33:45.666
I'll grow up before you do. What?

00:33:46.236 --> 00:33:47.266
You punk.

00:33:47.336 --> 00:33:49.406
You won't even buy your own dad a roll of gimbap,

00:33:49.666 --> 00:33:51.736
So where do you get off yelling at me like that?

00:33:52.436 --> 00:33:53.446
Am I a pushover?

00:33:53.806 --> 00:33:54.976
Quick, the money. Give me the money.

00:33:55.646 --> 00:33:57.016
Don't take that money.

00:33:57.376 --> 00:33:59.546
Do you have any idea what he did to earn it?

00:33:59.646 --> 00:34:01.086
How do you think he earned that money?

00:34:04.186 --> 00:34:06.056
Don't take that money. Please.

00:34:18.766 --> 00:34:20.036
What Gyu Seo said...

00:34:22.036 --> 00:34:23.236
What does he mean?

00:34:24.106 --> 00:34:25.136
Did you...

00:34:27.076 --> 00:34:29.076
Did you rob someone for this money?

00:34:33.346 --> 00:34:34.346
Are you not going to take it?

00:34:34.416 --> 00:34:36.586
I'm asking what you did to get this money.

00:34:37.286 --> 00:34:38.286
You're asking how I earned it?

00:34:38.356 --> 00:34:39.616
What does it matter how I earned it?

00:34:40.826 --> 00:34:42.486
If I earned it through dirty means, you don't need this money?

00:34:43.056 --> 00:34:44.156
You're not going to use it?

00:34:47.796 --> 00:34:49.326
You wouldn't have robbed someone, surely.

00:34:50.696 --> 00:34:52.396
My Gyu Oh is so upright...

00:34:52.996 --> 00:34:54.166
And righteous.

00:34:54.906 --> 00:34:57.606
When you were little, do you remember your dream was...

00:34:57.676 --> 00:34:58.776
To be a police officer catching bad guys?

00:35:00.776 --> 00:35:02.606
As long as you didn't steal it, it's fine.

00:35:03.146 --> 00:35:04.276
When it comes to money,

00:35:04.416 --> 00:35:06.616
You earn it like a dog and spend it like a king.

00:35:10.716 --> 00:35:12.156
I'll just count it later.

00:35:15.286 --> 00:35:16.286
I'm leaving.

00:35:33.646 --> 00:35:36.876
I don't know how much you know, but stay out of it.

00:35:42.086 --> 00:35:43.656
How can I stay out of it?

00:35:44.286 --> 00:35:45.656
When you're out there doing something so crazy,

00:35:45.716 --> 00:35:47.126
How can I possibly stay out of it?

00:35:49.226 --> 00:35:51.026
Dad is hopeless,

00:35:51.156 --> 00:35:52.526
But you're the bigger problem.

00:35:53.156 --> 00:35:54.166
You get it?

00:36:09.676 --> 00:36:10.676
What's this?

00:36:11.546 --> 00:36:12.916
It's the money I saved from my part-time job.

00:36:17.016 --> 00:36:18.286
Why are you giving this to me?

00:36:19.516 --> 00:36:21.356
I might be signing with a major company soon.

00:36:22.326 --> 00:36:23.756
No, I'm going to.

00:36:24.056 --> 00:36:25.196
So quit that crazy stuff you're doing...

00:36:25.256 --> 00:36:26.256
Before Gyu Rim finds out.

00:36:28.696 --> 00:36:30.766
If Gyu Rim finds out you're living like this,

00:36:32.466 --> 00:36:33.936
It'll kill her.

00:36:44.176 --> 00:36:45.216
Hey.

00:36:45.576 --> 00:36:46.716
Don't get smart.

00:36:47.946 --> 00:36:50.046
Forget about part-time jobs and just study.

00:36:50.456 --> 00:36:51.556
You're a student, aren't you?

00:36:52.656 --> 00:36:53.686
I'll give you one month.

00:36:55.056 --> 00:36:57.196
If you don't stop by then,

00:36:58.126 --> 00:36:59.496
I'm telling the whole family everything.

00:37:03.196 --> 00:37:04.296
It's my life.

00:37:05.166 --> 00:37:07.206
I live my own life, and I'll take responsibility for it.

00:37:07.266 --> 00:37:08.366
I earn my own money.

00:37:09.336 --> 00:37:10.336
So shut your mouth...

00:37:10.406 --> 00:37:11.776
And worry about your own life, you punk.

00:37:13.476 --> 00:37:14.646
How can you say that?

00:37:16.146 --> 00:37:18.316
If I were acting like trash, just like you,

00:37:18.576 --> 00:37:21.046
You're saying you'd just stand by and tell me to mind my own business?

00:37:21.386 --> 00:37:22.686
Could you really do that?

00:37:22.946 --> 00:37:25.316
Yes. I could do that.

00:37:25.716 --> 00:37:27.586
I absolutely could.

00:37:27.986 --> 00:37:29.326
Stop lying.

00:37:30.756 --> 00:37:32.896
Don't be ridiculous.

00:37:36.666 --> 00:37:38.936
I'm warning you one last time.

00:37:39.496 --> 00:37:41.006
Stay out of my life.

00:37:41.706 --> 00:37:44.636
If you run your mouth, I'll kill you.

00:37:45.036 --> 00:37:46.036
Got it, you little punk?

00:37:56.586 --> 00:37:57.586
Running away again?

00:37:59.886 --> 00:38:01.386
If you are going to run, do it right this time.

00:38:02.056 --> 00:38:03.326
So we never have to see each other again.

00:38:07.096 --> 00:38:09.096
Oh my goodness. What's going on?

00:38:09.166 --> 00:38:11.966
Goodness, the whole place is going to burn down.

00:38:12.036 --> 00:38:15.966
Oh, my goodness. Oh, dear.

00:38:16.536 --> 00:38:17.806
How did this happen?

00:38:18.106 --> 00:38:19.736
My goodness, did you fall asleep on your feet?

00:38:20.006 --> 00:38:21.006
Good grief.

00:38:21.306 --> 00:38:22.446
I'm sorry, ma'am.

00:38:22.706 --> 00:38:26.046
We should open a window, okay? Oh, dear.

00:39:12.556 --> 00:39:14.026
What is it, really?

00:39:15.026 --> 00:39:17.596
This is the first time I've ever seen you cry.

00:39:18.936 --> 00:39:19.996
I'm not crying.

00:39:21.066 --> 00:39:23.306
It's just that these onions are really strong, ma'am.

00:39:24.006 --> 00:39:26.106
It's not like this is the first time you've cut an onion.

00:39:26.306 --> 00:39:27.976
They're onions. They're supposed to be strong.

00:39:28.046 --> 00:39:32.546
- If not strong, are they onions? - But these are extra strong.

00:39:33.316 --> 00:39:34.946
We should change our supplier, ma'am.

00:39:35.916 --> 00:39:38.556
Yes, okay.

00:39:38.616 --> 00:39:41.286
We'll change it right away. Right away.

00:39:41.726 --> 00:39:43.896
I'll call Mr. Yang right now, okay?

00:40:18.756 --> 00:40:19.856
Did you drink all this?

00:40:22.596 --> 00:40:23.896
Why aren't you at work?

00:40:25.136 --> 00:40:26.536
I wasn't there. How could you not be there either?

00:40:26.696 --> 00:40:29.806
After you left like that, how could I possibly focus on work?

00:40:31.106 --> 00:40:32.476
Have you eaten?

00:40:33.636 --> 00:40:35.206
I was going to make a feast.

00:40:37.546 --> 00:40:38.576
But I burned it all.

00:40:42.616 --> 00:40:44.186
Oh, this...

00:40:46.086 --> 00:40:47.586
So you drank all this on an empty stomach?

00:40:50.496 --> 00:40:51.496
Looks like it.

00:40:53.096 --> 00:40:54.266
But I'm not drunk at all.

00:40:56.166 --> 00:40:57.166
Right.

00:40:57.666 --> 00:40:59.196
It would be weirder if you were okay.

00:41:03.336 --> 00:41:04.336
Want a drink?

00:41:04.806 --> 00:41:06.506
No, I'm good. For the life of me...

00:41:07.746 --> 00:41:09.106
I just can't seem to understand.

00:41:11.276 --> 00:41:12.276
What now?

00:41:13.746 --> 00:41:17.816
The Gyu Rim I know is not the type of woman to cheat, ever.

00:41:18.186 --> 00:41:19.856
That's the Gyu Rim you know too, right?

00:41:21.286 --> 00:41:22.526
Let's stop talking about Gyu Rim.

00:41:22.586 --> 00:41:24.396
That monkey-faced guy...

00:41:24.526 --> 00:41:26.356
I'm sure she only met him after you broke up.

00:41:26.726 --> 00:41:27.796
I said, let's drop it.

00:41:27.996 --> 00:41:29.226
But the kid is eight years old.

00:41:29.596 --> 00:41:30.596
Does that make sense?

00:41:32.166 --> 00:41:34.306
You've been thinking it doesn't add up either.

00:41:37.176 --> 00:41:38.176
So?

00:41:38.406 --> 00:41:39.406
Gyu Rim's son.

00:41:41.506 --> 00:41:43.006
I don't think he's that monkey's son.

00:41:44.676 --> 00:41:46.176
They don't look anything alike.

00:41:46.246 --> 00:41:49.116
If anything, his eyes and nose look more like...

00:41:50.686 --> 00:41:52.356
This is too much.

00:41:53.716 --> 00:41:56.256
Okay, stop getting carried away, Park Jung Woo.

00:42:01.726 --> 00:42:03.166
Gosh.

00:42:32.596 --> 00:42:33.596
Hey, wait a minute.

00:42:37.196 --> 00:42:38.466
Sorry.

00:42:38.996 --> 00:42:40.366
I thought you were someone I knew.

00:42:41.606 --> 00:42:42.666
Dad.

00:42:51.016 --> 00:42:52.346
You've got it bad. Really bad.

00:42:53.846 --> 00:42:54.846
What do you mean?

00:42:55.886 --> 00:42:57.886
Yesterday, you chased after a kid about that age.

00:42:57.956 --> 00:42:58.956
You even said the same thing.

00:42:59.316 --> 00:43:01.256
"Sorry, I thought you were someone I knew."

00:43:02.326 --> 00:43:03.326
Who is this person you know?

00:43:03.386 --> 00:43:05.256
Who are you looking for so desperately?

00:43:07.896 --> 00:43:08.896
Why?

00:43:08.996 --> 00:43:11.036
Can't you get Han Gyu Rim's son out of your head?

00:43:18.336 --> 00:43:20.906
Your game account has been activated.

00:43:35.386 --> 00:43:37.626
What's with him all of a sudden? He's making me nervous.

00:44:13.156 --> 00:44:15.566
Let's go to the department store to buy some clothes.

00:44:16.826 --> 00:44:18.036
Clothes? Why all of a sudden?

00:44:18.496 --> 00:44:20.166
For the formal family meeting.

00:44:20.336 --> 00:44:21.906
Who's having a family meeting?

00:44:22.366 --> 00:44:23.366
Gyu Young.

00:44:23.566 --> 00:44:24.576
What?

00:44:25.206 --> 00:44:27.306
I heard her on the phone with her friend just now.

00:44:27.776 --> 00:44:30.106
It's at one o'clock today at Changdeokgung in Gangnam.

00:44:31.276 --> 00:44:33.816
That's the place famous for marinated short ribs, right?

00:44:44.256 --> 00:44:45.556
Are you having a family meeting today?

00:44:47.496 --> 00:44:48.496
How did you know?

00:44:48.826 --> 00:44:51.896
You're having a family meeting, was I not supposed to know about it?

00:44:55.506 --> 00:44:56.506
So annoying.

00:44:57.206 --> 00:44:59.536
I wasn't going to invite you, so just pretend you don't know.

00:45:01.946 --> 00:45:03.706
How can I pretend I don't know?

00:45:04.516 --> 00:45:06.946
- Are you an orphan? - Yes, I told them I'm an orphan,

00:45:07.016 --> 00:45:08.716
So just mind your business and drop it.

00:45:09.786 --> 00:45:11.486
How can you be an orphan?

00:45:12.056 --> 00:45:14.456
You have a father, a sister, and younger siblings.

00:45:14.556 --> 00:45:17.626
You have so much family. Hey, that's fraud.

00:45:20.556 --> 00:45:21.566
Han Gyu Young.

00:45:23.426 --> 00:45:25.366
So you were going to go there all by yourself?

00:45:26.096 --> 00:45:27.096
Exactly.

00:45:27.136 --> 00:45:28.336
I told them my mom passed away long ago...

00:45:28.406 --> 00:45:30.406
And that my father died a few years ago.

00:45:30.636 --> 00:45:32.376
I said my siblings were all busy or away on business trips.

00:45:34.076 --> 00:45:36.006
You told them that I died?

00:45:36.806 --> 00:45:39.416
But I'm standing right here, perfectly fine.

00:45:41.746 --> 00:45:42.886
This isn't right, Han Gyu Young.

00:45:43.916 --> 00:45:47.016
No matter how crazy you are, you shouldn't have done this.

00:45:47.826 --> 00:45:50.056
If I bring you and Father and you end up ruining my marriage,

00:45:50.726 --> 00:45:51.756
Are you going to take responsibility?

00:45:53.296 --> 00:45:55.766
Why would Father and I ruin your marriage?

00:45:56.626 --> 00:45:58.736
Because to me, our family is an embarrassment,

00:45:58.796 --> 00:46:00.136
A disgrace, and a humiliation.

00:46:00.806 --> 00:46:01.806
My gosh...

00:46:02.366 --> 00:46:04.376
What in the world is she saying to us?

00:46:05.136 --> 00:46:07.976
Honestly, is there a single decent person in this family?

00:46:08.306 --> 00:46:10.546
Other than me, is there anyone you can be proud of?

00:46:11.216 --> 00:46:13.446
You're all uneducated, pathetic, and ignorant.

00:46:17.146 --> 00:46:19.416
I'll go to a department store and buy the most expensive outfit.

00:46:20.216 --> 00:46:22.326
I'll barely say a word so I don't look ignorant.

00:46:23.186 --> 00:46:25.056
It's not like you can hide this forever.

00:46:25.596 --> 00:46:26.996
Lying like this is wrong.

00:46:27.726 --> 00:46:30.666
That's right. If I get all dressed up,

00:46:31.166 --> 00:46:33.196
People mistake me for a CEO of a major corporation.

00:46:33.266 --> 00:46:37.336
I already told them. I already told them you're dead.

00:46:38.736 --> 00:46:40.376
How many times is she going to kill me off today?

00:46:46.646 --> 00:46:49.546
Gosh. What do you mean?

00:46:50.186 --> 00:46:51.786
What do you mean, where are you going...

00:46:51.786 --> 00:46:53.056
That you can't decide whether to go or not?

00:46:53.416 --> 00:46:55.856
Well, if you tell me to go, I'll go.

00:46:55.926 --> 00:46:57.596
And if you tell me not to go, I won't.

00:46:59.226 --> 00:47:01.266
So where is it you're going?

00:47:02.696 --> 00:47:05.236
Well, someone asked me a favour, and...

00:47:07.666 --> 00:47:09.736
They asked me to attend the family meeting as their father.

00:47:11.136 --> 00:47:13.006
Does this person not have parents?

00:47:13.836 --> 00:47:15.576
I'm not so sure about that.

00:47:17.076 --> 00:47:18.646
Who asked you?

00:47:20.176 --> 00:47:21.486
A distant relative. Yes.

00:47:22.316 --> 00:47:23.546
Is it someone I know?

00:47:24.286 --> 00:47:25.956
Well, you might know them. Yes.

00:47:26.456 --> 00:47:27.456
Well...

00:47:28.426 --> 00:47:30.686
Have I met them before?

00:47:31.996 --> 00:47:33.456
You've probably met them. Yes.

00:47:33.526 --> 00:47:34.526
Anyway, should I go or not?

00:47:37.196 --> 00:47:38.466
You say they're a relative,

00:47:38.636 --> 00:47:40.566
But you don't even know if they have parents.

00:47:40.636 --> 00:47:41.736
What's with that?

00:47:42.606 --> 00:47:43.806
What's their name?

00:47:45.206 --> 00:47:46.206
Their name?

00:47:48.476 --> 00:47:49.746
Well...

00:47:50.376 --> 00:47:51.946
- Oh my. - It's...

00:47:52.176 --> 00:47:54.516
You don't know their name? And they're a relative?

00:47:57.046 --> 00:47:58.686
For someone whose name you don't even know,

00:47:58.916 --> 00:48:00.456
You're going to attend a family meeting in their place?

00:48:00.856 --> 00:48:01.856
Does that make any sense?

00:48:03.026 --> 00:48:04.656
Right. It doesn't make sense.

00:48:05.956 --> 00:48:08.466
Then should I not go?

00:48:11.496 --> 00:48:12.496
Good grief.

00:48:12.996 --> 00:48:15.206
A young person like you should be more careful.

00:48:15.306 --> 00:48:17.036
(Seonghan High School)

00:48:17.106 --> 00:48:18.106
Is this it?

00:48:18.636 --> 00:48:20.576
- Yes. - Hey.

00:48:22.106 --> 00:48:23.106
You're ashamed of me too, aren't you?

00:48:24.376 --> 00:48:27.216
Even though you're so ashamed of me, I was the only one home,

00:48:27.646 --> 00:48:28.916
So you asked me to come, right?

00:48:29.746 --> 00:48:31.486
- What are you talking about? - Hey.

00:48:32.186 --> 00:48:33.416
Am I a disgrace, an embarrassment,

00:48:33.486 --> 00:48:34.856
And the lowest of the low to you too?

00:48:35.056 --> 00:48:36.056
Did Han Gyu Seo tell you that?

00:48:37.126 --> 00:48:38.196
Gyu Seo feels that way too?

00:48:38.896 --> 00:48:40.296
That little brat.

00:48:40.396 --> 00:48:41.396
Was it Gyu Oh?

00:48:41.596 --> 00:48:42.796
Gyu Oh feels that way too?

00:48:43.626 --> 00:48:46.236
That kid. And to think he's my eldest son.

00:48:46.296 --> 00:48:48.206
Oh, was it Han Gyu Young?

00:48:49.306 --> 00:48:50.306
Yes.

00:48:50.706 --> 00:48:52.806
That girl has her family meeting today,

00:48:53.036 --> 00:48:54.106
And she told her future in-laws...

00:48:55.376 --> 00:48:56.546
She said I was dead.

00:48:57.346 --> 00:48:59.976
I was completely humiliated by your sister.

00:49:01.146 --> 00:49:02.246
What are you talking about?

00:49:02.546 --> 00:49:04.356
She said our whole family is an embarrassment.

00:49:05.356 --> 00:49:08.456
Everyone and even Gyu Rim... That brat told us not to come.

00:49:10.186 --> 00:49:11.756
Fine, I'm not going.

00:49:11.826 --> 00:49:13.696
It's so humiliating, I'm not going either.

00:49:19.366 --> 00:49:21.566
- Go on in. - Right.

00:49:22.406 --> 00:49:23.606
You should at least say goodbye.

00:49:25.706 --> 00:49:27.706
(Seonghan High School)

00:49:28.976 --> 00:49:29.976
Unbelievable.

00:49:45.626 --> 00:49:47.726
It's fine. Don't worry about it. Okay?

00:49:48.096 --> 00:49:50.426
She's a girl who thinks she's all that anyway.

00:49:50.696 --> 00:49:51.696
She'll handle it herself.

00:49:53.566 --> 00:49:55.806
Seriously. That brat.

00:50:04.776 --> 00:50:06.676
Hello. Gyu Min, why are you calling at this hour?

00:50:07.746 --> 00:50:10.516
Dad took a taxi to go where Han Gyu Young is.

00:50:12.156 --> 00:50:13.156
What are you talking about?

00:50:13.416 --> 00:50:15.956
I told him to go and crash the whole thing.

00:50:16.826 --> 00:50:18.426
What do you mean by that?

00:50:18.796 --> 00:50:20.626
Is Han Gyu Young having her family meeting today?

00:50:21.626 --> 00:50:24.666
What? Father went to Gyu Young's family meeting?

00:50:36.176 --> 00:50:38.716
(Father)

00:50:42.486 --> 00:50:43.946
Father, please.

00:51:20.916 --> 00:51:23.026
- Gyu Young, you're here? - Yes.

00:51:23.086 --> 00:51:24.556
Mother, Father, you're here?

00:51:25.926 --> 00:51:28.566
- Did you have trouble getting here? - You're already here, honey?

00:51:29.126 --> 00:51:30.396
Is your father here as well?

00:51:31.136 --> 00:51:33.566
No. He said he might be a little late for a meeting.

00:51:33.636 --> 00:51:35.166
He asked me to tell you he's sorry.

00:51:35.866 --> 00:51:37.636
He should be arriving any minute now.

00:51:38.006 --> 00:51:40.106
We just came a bit early.

00:51:40.306 --> 00:51:42.476
Tell him not to worry and to take his time.

00:51:42.876 --> 00:51:43.876
Yes, Mother.

00:51:44.546 --> 00:51:46.876
Show my father and mother inside first.

00:51:47.076 --> 00:51:48.786
I'll go in with my dad when he gets here.

00:51:49.186 --> 00:51:51.056
All right. Please, go on in.

00:51:51.256 --> 00:51:54.556
Son, your father and I will head inside first.

00:51:54.956 --> 00:51:57.386
You should greet your father-in-law and come in together.

00:51:58.256 --> 00:52:00.196
No, it's all right. I can show him in.

00:52:00.626 --> 00:52:01.826
It's fine.

00:52:01.896 --> 00:52:03.966
- Do as she says. - Yes.

00:52:10.466 --> 00:52:11.776
You should go in too.

00:52:11.906 --> 00:52:12.906
No, it's okay.

00:52:13.006 --> 00:52:14.176
This is my first time formally greeting him,

00:52:14.236 --> 00:52:15.946
So of course I should wait and escort him inside.

00:52:16.146 --> 00:52:18.616
Honey.

00:52:21.486 --> 00:52:22.646
Well,

00:52:23.146 --> 00:52:25.356
- I wonder when he'll arrive. - Soon, I guess.

00:52:26.786 --> 00:52:29.626
(Father)

00:52:37.066 --> 00:52:38.066
Dad.

00:52:38.696 --> 00:52:40.566
I'm not too late, am I?

00:52:41.136 --> 00:52:42.606
No. You're not late at all.

00:52:43.366 --> 00:52:45.306
It's a pleasure to meet you, sir. I'm Kang Sung Wook.

00:52:45.776 --> 00:52:46.776
Yes, it's a pleasure to meet you.

00:52:47.606 --> 00:52:49.046
Mother and Father are already here.

00:52:49.176 --> 00:52:50.176
Let's hurry inside, Dad.

00:52:53.316 --> 00:52:55.316
All right. Let's go in.

00:53:02.986 --> 00:53:03.986
Where are you, Father?

00:53:04.426 --> 00:53:05.556
I don't know either.

00:53:06.056 --> 00:53:07.056
Father.

00:53:07.756 --> 00:53:10.296
- Where are we? - Ma'am, what neighbourhood is this?

00:53:10.426 --> 00:53:11.436
Yaksu-dong.

00:53:12.696 --> 00:53:13.796
She said it's Yaksu-dong.

00:53:14.506 --> 00:53:15.606
Why are you there?

00:53:16.106 --> 00:53:17.536
Weren't you on your way to Gyu Young's?

00:53:17.876 --> 00:53:19.576
I got out of the taxi on the way.

00:53:20.176 --> 00:53:21.176
I was afraid if I went,

00:53:21.706 --> 00:53:24.946
That girl would lose her mind and start foaming at the mouth.

00:53:26.146 --> 00:53:27.146
Oh, gosh.

00:53:30.346 --> 00:53:33.116
Even though she's my daughter, I'm that scared of Gyu Young.

00:53:34.356 --> 00:53:36.786
Ma'am, one bowl of rice, please.

00:53:37.186 --> 00:53:38.196
Okay.

00:53:38.796 --> 00:53:39.996
You did the right thing.

00:53:40.126 --> 00:53:41.266
It was good you got out.

00:53:42.666 --> 00:53:43.666
You did the right thing.

00:53:59.946 --> 00:54:01.186
It's a pleasure to meet you all.

00:54:07.586 --> 00:54:08.826
This wine might be expensive,

00:54:09.426 --> 00:54:10.726
But it's a bit lacking in flavour, don't you think?

00:54:13.026 --> 00:54:14.526
This is our first time meeting as in-laws,

00:54:14.666 --> 00:54:16.296
And I told you to get the Romanée-Conti.

00:54:19.366 --> 00:54:21.636
Well, I actually drink makgeolli or soju more often.

00:54:22.006 --> 00:54:23.706
I don't really know much about wine.

00:54:24.436 --> 00:54:26.776
Besides, if I drink something this expensive,

00:54:26.776 --> 00:54:28.506
I feel like I can't even get properly drunk.

00:54:29.276 --> 00:54:30.276
That's right.

00:54:30.546 --> 00:54:32.676
Your father is so down-to-earth.

00:54:32.916 --> 00:54:35.546
Especially since he looks like a French nobleman.

00:54:39.086 --> 00:54:41.656
How many guests are you considering?

00:54:44.956 --> 00:54:47.726
Well, we have a small family.

00:54:49.766 --> 00:54:50.766
What do you think?

00:54:53.236 --> 00:54:56.206
I'd like to have a small wedding.

00:54:56.406 --> 00:54:58.436
Thirty people at most?

00:54:59.636 --> 00:55:01.576
Oh my, that few?

00:55:02.676 --> 00:55:05.616
We were thinking at least 150.

00:55:08.786 --> 00:55:11.356
Just invite a similar number to Gyu Young's side.

00:55:12.016 --> 00:55:14.056
Son, how can we do that?

00:55:14.286 --> 00:55:16.386
Then who do we invite and who do we leave out?

00:55:18.596 --> 00:55:19.926
As you may know,

00:55:20.496 --> 00:55:21.766
In our world, you have to worry about...

00:55:21.826 --> 00:55:23.366
Politics, business, and all sorts of things.

00:55:23.426 --> 00:55:24.426
It's a headache.

00:55:25.196 --> 00:55:26.296
The bigger the figure,

00:55:26.366 --> 00:55:28.366
The more they sulk over trivial matters.

00:55:31.006 --> 00:55:33.206
What are your thoughts?

00:55:35.846 --> 00:55:38.876
Well, I'd like to do whatever the children want.

00:55:39.946 --> 00:55:42.016
It's their wedding, after all.

00:55:44.016 --> 00:55:45.016
Yes.

00:55:46.156 --> 00:55:47.956
Let's get along well from now on.

00:55:49.086 --> 00:55:51.396
- Yes. - Any difficulties, let us know.

00:55:51.596 --> 00:55:54.666
- Please take care of our Gyu Young. - Of course.

00:55:54.726 --> 00:55:55.726
Oh, right.

00:55:56.866 --> 00:55:58.936
I almost forgot this.

00:56:01.936 --> 00:56:04.166
- What is this? - The list of wedding gifts.

00:56:04.806 --> 00:56:06.436
I put together a simple list.

00:56:06.936 --> 00:56:08.276
If your mother were here,

00:56:08.346 --> 00:56:10.476
She would have known to prepare everything,

00:56:10.906 --> 00:56:14.616
But I was worried you might panic and not know what to do on your own.

00:56:16.986 --> 00:56:19.086
Yes, thank you, Mother.

00:56:20.256 --> 00:56:22.486
We'll invite you to our home next time.

00:56:22.556 --> 00:56:23.626
Yes, thank you.

00:56:23.956 --> 00:56:26.496
- Okay. - We'll be on our way, then.

00:56:26.556 --> 00:56:27.556
Okay, see you later.

00:56:28.426 --> 00:56:29.996
- I'm off. - Goodbye.

00:56:30.826 --> 00:56:31.836
I'll call you when I get home.

00:56:31.996 --> 00:56:34.806
- Okay. - Sir, I'll be going now.

00:56:34.866 --> 00:56:36.766
- All right, see you again soon. - Yes.

00:56:48.446 --> 00:56:49.616
(List Of Wedding Gifts And Furnishings)

00:56:58.056 --> 00:56:59.456
So, did everything go well?

00:57:05.736 --> 00:57:07.366
Thank you so much for today.

00:57:08.466 --> 00:57:10.266
I was so nervous you wouldn't come.

00:57:10.806 --> 00:57:12.236
But is this a marriage you must have,

00:57:12.336 --> 00:57:13.736
Even if it means going to these lengths?

00:57:17.006 --> 00:57:18.006
Right.

00:57:18.476 --> 00:57:20.346
I may have become an unwilling accomplice,

00:57:21.716 --> 00:57:25.686
But this will only hurt your family. And if your in-laws find out later,

00:57:26.616 --> 00:57:27.856
It could become a huge problem.

00:57:27.916 --> 00:57:29.026
Can you take responsibility for that?

00:57:32.126 --> 00:57:33.556
I'll cross that bridge when I get to it.

00:57:34.596 --> 00:57:36.826
I don't expect someone like you to understand, Chairman,

00:57:37.066 --> 00:57:38.766
But this marriage is something I desperately need.

00:57:39.236 --> 00:57:41.096
So much so that I'm willing to do anything.

00:57:48.506 --> 00:57:49.506
I see.

00:57:50.446 --> 00:57:52.076
I should get going.

00:57:54.476 --> 00:57:56.446
My mom really made the right choice to get a divorce.

00:57:59.756 --> 00:58:01.586
It's how she got to meet a great man like you.

00:58:07.096 --> 00:58:08.226
I really mean it.

00:58:32.216 --> 00:58:33.686
What is it? Is something wrong?

00:58:34.316 --> 00:58:35.726
No, it's nothing.

00:58:36.756 --> 00:58:37.986
By the way, where's Gyeol?

00:58:38.426 --> 00:58:39.756
I've been looking for him, but I can't find him.

00:58:40.256 --> 00:58:41.696
He's not in his room?

00:58:44.466 --> 00:58:45.696
What?

00:58:48.466 --> 00:58:50.766
- Hey, Mom. - Where are you right now?

00:58:51.876 --> 00:58:53.076
In front of the burger place.

00:58:53.236 --> 00:58:54.476
I'm here to meet someone.

00:58:55.046 --> 00:58:56.046
Who?

00:58:59.576 --> 00:59:00.746
Game Man.

00:59:01.686 --> 00:59:03.216
Why are you meeting him?

00:59:04.046 --> 00:59:06.586
He bought me some in-game items.

00:59:06.986 --> 00:59:09.056
The most popular and expensive ones, too.

00:59:09.526 --> 00:59:11.326
The exact ones I wanted most.

00:59:11.726 --> 00:59:14.356
I think he's a nicer person than I thought.

00:59:20.436 --> 00:59:22.406
Gyeol, not you too. What are you doing?

00:59:22.966 --> 00:59:25.136
You should tell me when things like that happen.

00:59:25.636 --> 00:59:27.336
If you haven't met him yet, come home right now.

00:59:27.776 --> 00:59:28.946
I already met him.

00:59:35.416 --> 00:59:37.316
I'll be home soon. Don't worry.

00:59:39.756 --> 00:59:40.756
Hey.

00:59:40.886 --> 00:59:41.956
Hello.

00:59:42.326 --> 00:59:44.126
I wanted to properly apologise.

00:59:45.456 --> 00:59:46.856
I'm the one who should be apologising.

00:59:46.926 --> 00:59:49.966
For being disrespectful to an adult. I'm sorry, sir.

00:59:53.136 --> 00:59:54.666
Have you eaten dinner?

00:59:55.036 --> 00:59:56.036
No.

00:59:56.636 --> 00:59:57.636
How about a burger?

00:59:57.706 --> 00:59:59.506
Yes, it's my absolute favourite food.

01:00:01.236 --> 01:00:02.346
I think I'll have...

01:00:02.876 --> 01:00:04.346
The chicken mozzarella.

01:00:04.706 --> 01:00:06.746
What? That's my favourite too.

01:00:07.816 --> 01:00:08.816
Toppings?

01:00:08.816 --> 01:00:11.216
No onions or pickles. Add a fried egg.

01:00:12.516 --> 01:00:13.786
Wow, that's my order exactly.

01:00:14.216 --> 01:00:15.956
- Should we go in? - Yes.

01:00:18.996 --> 01:00:21.056
The person you are calling is unavailable...

01:00:49.526 --> 01:00:51.856
(Mom)

01:00:54.126 --> 01:00:55.126
Answer it.

01:00:55.426 --> 01:00:56.496
It's okay.

01:00:58.636 --> 01:01:00.836
Who is it? Your mom?

01:01:08.376 --> 01:01:09.376
Mom.

01:01:10.446 --> 01:01:12.016
I told you I'd be home soon.

01:01:15.046 --> 01:01:18.116
- Let's go. - I haven't finished my burger yet.

01:01:18.486 --> 01:01:20.956
Eat at home. Let's go now.

01:01:21.856 --> 01:01:23.456
Wait, I forgot my phone.

01:01:25.456 --> 01:01:26.456
Got it.

01:01:32.036 --> 01:01:33.036
Ms. Han.

01:01:36.066 --> 01:01:37.406
Can we talk for a minute?

01:01:39.806 --> 01:01:41.006
I have nothing to say to you.

01:01:42.746 --> 01:01:45.116
Come on, Mom. You should make up with him.

01:01:45.516 --> 01:01:47.316
I'm telling you, he seems like a really great guy.

01:01:47.846 --> 01:01:50.486
Why? Because he bought you a few silly in-game items?

01:01:50.616 --> 01:01:51.856
You were won over that easily?

01:01:52.416 --> 01:01:54.416
You're already letting things like that sway you.

01:01:54.686 --> 01:01:55.786
I'm disappointed in you, Han Gyeol.

01:01:59.056 --> 01:02:00.126
Ms. Han.

01:02:01.496 --> 01:02:03.066
After my mom went to the police station,

01:02:03.126 --> 01:02:04.596
She was really shaken up.

01:02:04.896 --> 01:02:06.296
She said she even burned the kimchi pancakes.

01:02:06.866 --> 01:02:07.866
Let's go.

01:02:22.116 --> 01:02:23.486
Gyeol, you go on home.

01:02:23.916 --> 01:02:25.956
I'm going to talk to him for a minute.

01:02:26.516 --> 01:02:27.586
Are you going to make up?

01:02:27.656 --> 01:02:30.856
Good idea. Just go ahead and make up, Mom.

01:02:31.756 --> 01:02:33.656
- Go. - Okay, you can do it.

01:02:47.436 --> 01:02:48.446
From now on,

01:02:48.876 --> 01:02:51.276
Do not arrange to meet with Gyeol.

01:02:52.616 --> 01:02:54.246
Do not send him notes...

01:02:54.876 --> 01:02:57.046
And do not send him things like game items.

01:02:58.416 --> 01:02:59.456
I'm asking you.

01:03:00.456 --> 01:03:03.086
I hope we don't have to see each other again.

01:03:05.756 --> 01:03:07.256
I have a question.

01:03:12.196 --> 01:03:13.196
Is it possible...

01:03:14.736 --> 01:03:15.836
He's my son?

01:03:24.106 --> 01:03:25.176
Is Gyeol...

01:03:26.216 --> 01:03:27.346
My son?

01:03:59.676 --> 01:04:01.616
(Love on the Menu)

01:04:01.676 --> 01:04:03.686
Gyeol said he's eight years old.

01:04:03.946 --> 01:04:05.286
We broke up eight years ago.

01:04:05.286 --> 01:04:07.356
Were you cheating on me when we were together?

01:04:07.616 --> 01:04:10.356
- That's a lie. - Mom. Ms. Han Gyu Rim.

01:04:10.726 --> 01:04:13.096
- Oh, Gyeol. - Why is my mom acting so strange?

01:04:13.156 --> 01:04:15.766
She's been acting really strange since she met Game Man.

01:04:15.896 --> 01:04:18.426
A negative plus a negative makes a strong positive, you know?

01:04:18.536 --> 01:04:20.466
That means a strong positive. A really strong one at that.

01:04:20.536 --> 01:04:22.466
- You know me, right? - No, I don't think so.

01:04:22.536 --> 01:04:24.136
Snap out of it. I'm not your boyfriend.

01:04:24.236 --> 01:04:25.306
I see...

01:04:25.306 --> 01:04:27.476
Don't you think this is a bit much?

01:04:27.636 --> 01:04:29.176
Then are you going to pay for the apartment, Gyu Young?

01:04:29.346 --> 01:04:30.946
Han Gyu Oh, do you have some money?

01:04:31.076 --> 01:04:32.616
If you said you were struggling or needed something,

01:04:32.676 --> 01:04:34.676
There were plenty of women who would bring it right to you.

01:04:34.746 --> 01:04:36.216
It was Gyu Young's formal family meeting.

01:04:36.616 --> 01:04:38.416
Gyu Young, it's Mom.

01:04:38.986 --> 01:04:40.616
It's been a while, Mom.

